1103
01:34:21,403 --> 01:34:26,403
Yeah , really . They had me by the balls . The next thing I know , I 'm in Saigon .

1104
01:34:26,784 --> 01:34:31,663
I 'm working in a top-secret lab synthesizing mind-altering drugs .

1105
01:34:31,664 --> 01:34:32,747
